  "prefLabel": "Fors 401.04 Denial of Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 401.04 Denial of Renewal. Renewal shall be denied if the OPLC finds:\n\n(a) Noncompliance with the continuing education requirements of Fors 403.01;\n\n(b) Any unethical act for which discipline shall be imposed under Fors 500;\n\n(c) Any acts of misconduct as described RSA 310-A:112; or\n\n(d) Failure to furnish complete or accurate information on an initial or renewal license application.\n\nSource. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14086, eff 11-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fors100-500.html"
